<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.6.6">
<l>nāṭum nakaru maṟiya māṉiṭap pēriṭṭu</l>
<l>kūṭi yaḻuṅkik kuḻiyil vīḻntu vaḻukkātē</l>
<l>cāṭi ṟappāyn tatalaivā tāmōta rāveṉṟu</l>
<l>nāṭumiṉ nāraṇaṉ tamaṉṉai narakam pukāḷ.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Don’t give the name of a man</l>
<l rend="indent">such that it is known in city and country,</l>
<l>and fall down and suffer in the pit along with [him]</l>
<l rend="indent">without escape,</l>
<l>seek [Him instead],</l>
<l rend="indent">saying “Leader who lept to break the cart! Dāmodara!”</l>
<l>The mother of Nāraṇa will not go to hell.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
